# GitHub workflow

- Never implement a task on `main`. Create a branch first: `type/scope-short-description`.
- Scopes: `mobile`, `backend`, `telegram`, `firmware`, `shared`, `api-client`, `docker`, `docs`, `monorepo`.
- One PR = one concern. Do not mix firmware IR work with Expo UI.
- Commits: `type(scope): subject` in English, imperative.
- PR titles: `[TYPE][SCOPE] Short description in English`.
- Follow `docs/GITHUB.md`. Use skills `start-task` and `submit-pr-for-review` when the user starts or finishes a task.
- Never commit secrets (`.env`, tokens, WiFi, MQTT passwords, real Telegram IDs).
